      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "An object shaped like a ring sits centered on dark stone under soft studio light, the camera locked off and perfectly static. Over the course of the clip the ring undergoes one continuous, seamless metamorphosis: it begins as a polished chrome metal ring, then slowly transforms into living plant matter with roots, stems and green leaves that hold the same ring silhouette, then the plant matter becomes wet organic flesh that softly breathes while keeping the same ring shape, and finally the flesh becomes a mechanical organism of brass and steel with articulated joints and pistons, still holding the same ring silhouette. Continuous unbroken transformation, the object never leaves its position, no cuts, no camera movement, no text, no people.",
        480,
        832,
        124
      ],
      "title": "H3 image-to-video (first frame + prompt)"
